# Theme Plymouth ThibsDarts (genere par os/splash/make-theme.py, ne pas modifier a la main).
# "DartOS" en haut, la tete de Thibs tourne au centre, une barre avance dessous et ses phrases defilent.

NB_FRAMES = 28;
FRAME_MS = 70;
NB_QUOTES = 10;
QUOTE_TICKS = 200;   # 4 s par phrase (le rafraichissement tourne a 50 Hz)
FADE_TICKS = 20;

Window.SetBackgroundTopColor(0, 0, 0);
Window.SetBackgroundBottomColor(0, 0, 0);

W = Window.GetWidth();
H = Window.GetHeight();
# Images dessinees pour un ecran de 600 px de haut.
k = Math.Min(H / 600, W / 1024);

fun pad(n) {
  if (n < 10) return "0" + n;
  return "" + n;
}

fun scaled(img) {
  if (global.k == 1) return img;
  return img.Scale(Math.Int(img.GetWidth() * global.k), Math.Int(img.GetHeight() * global.k));
}

for (i = 0; i < NB_FRAMES; i++)
  frames[i] = scaled(Image("frame-" + pad(i) + ".png"));
for (i = 0; i < NB_QUOTES; i++)
  quotes[i] = scaled(Image("quote-" + pad(i) + ".png"));

head = Sprite(frames[0]);
head.SetX(Math.Int((W - frames[0].GetWidth()) / 2));
head.SetY(Math.Int(H * 0.47 - frames[0].GetHeight() / 2));
head.SetZ(1);

title_img = scaled(Image("title.png"));
title = Sprite(title_img);
title.SetPosition(Math.Int((W - title_img.GetWidth()) / 2), Math.Int(H * 0.06), 2);

bar_track = scaled(Image("bar-track.png"));
bar_fill_src = Image("bar-fill.png");
bar_w = bar_track.GetWidth();
bar_h = bar_track.GetHeight();
bar_x = Math.Int((W - bar_w) / 2);
bar_y = Math.Int(H * 0.8);
track = Sprite(bar_track);
track.SetPosition(bar_x, bar_y, 2);
fill = Sprite();
fill.SetPosition(bar_x, bar_y, 3);

quote = Sprite();
quote.SetZ(2);
quote_y = Math.Int(bar_y + bar_h + 22 * k);

tick = 0;
progress = 0;
shown = 0;
q = Math.Int(Math.Random() * NB_QUOTES) % NB_QUOTES;

fun show_quote() {
  img = global.quotes[global.q];
  global.quote.SetImage(img);
  global.quote.SetX(Math.Int((global.W - img.GetWidth()) / 2));
  global.quote.SetY(global.quote_y);
}
show_quote();

fun boot_progress(duration, p) {
  global.progress = p;
}
Plymouth.SetBootProgressFunction(boot_progress);

last_w = -1;
bar_visible = 1;

fun refresh() {
  global.tick = global.tick + 1;
  tk = global.tick;

  # GIF : une image toutes les FRAME_MS millisecondes.
  f = Math.Int(tk * 20 / global.FRAME_MS) % global.NB_FRAMES;
  global.head.SetImage(global.frames[f]);

  # Barre : on suit l'estimation de Plymouth, avec un minimum qui avance tout seul
  # (sur un systeme en lecture seule Plymouth ne retient pas la duree du demarrage).
  lent = 1 - 1 / (1 + tk / 900);
  cible = Math.Max(global.progress, lent);
  if (global.inst_to > 0) {
    # Premier demarrage : la barre suit les etapes de l'installation et avance doucement vers la suivante.
    d = (tk - global.inst_tick) / 1500;
    cible = global.inst_from + (global.inst_to - global.inst_from) * (1 - 1 / (1 + d));
  }
  if (cible > global.shown) global.shown = global.shown + (cible - global.shown) * 0.08;
  w = Math.Int(global.bar_w * Math.Min(global.shown, 1));
  if (w != global.last_w && global.bar_visible) {
    global.last_w = w;
    if (w >= global.bar_h) {
      global.fill.SetImage(global.bar_fill_src.Scale(w, global.bar_h));
      global.fill.SetOpacity(1);
    } else {
      global.fill.SetOpacity(0);
    }
  }

  # Phrases : une toutes les 4 s, avec un fondu.
  t = tk % global.QUOTE_TICKS;
  if (t == 0) {
    global.q = (global.q + 1) % global.NB_QUOTES;
    show_quote();
  }
  a = 0.8;
  if (t < global.FADE_TICKS) a = 0.8 * t / global.FADE_TICKS;
  if (t > global.QUOTE_TICKS - global.FADE_TICKS) a = 0.8 * (global.QUOTE_TICKS - t) / global.FADE_TICKS;
  global.quote.SetOpacity(a);
}
Plymouth.SetRefreshFunction(refresh);

# A l'extinction, pas de barre : juste la tete et les phrases.
mode = Plymouth.GetMode();
if (mode == "shutdown" || mode == "reboot") {
  bar_visible = 0;
  track.SetOpacity(0);
  fill.SetOpacity(0);
}

# Pas de texte systeme a l'ecran (messages, mots de passe).
# Etapes du premier demarrage envoyees par thibsdarts-firstboot :
# plymouth update --status=install-N (N de 1 a 5).
inst_from = 0;
inst_to = 0;
inst_tick = 0;
fun install_step(from, to) {
  global.inst_from = Math.Max(from, global.shown);
  global.inst_to = to;
  global.inst_tick = global.tick;
}
fun update_status(status) {
  if (status == "install-1") install_step(0.05, 0.25);
  if (status == "install-2") install_step(0.25, 0.4);
  if (status == "install-3") install_step(0.4, 0.6);
  if (status == "install-4") install_step(0.6, 0.95);
  if (status == "install-5") install_step(1, 1);
}
Plymouth.SetUpdateStatusFunction(update_status);

fun nothing(text) {
  return;
}
Plymouth.SetMessageFunction(nothing);
